---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Accessibility Statement | South Rock Industries" description="South Rock Industries' accessibility statement and WCAG 2.1 AA commitment.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
      <p>
        South Rock Industries is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for all visitors,
        including individuals with disabilities. We continually work to improve the user
        experience for everyone and apply relevant accessibility standards.
      </p>

      <h2>Accessibility Standards</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA, which
        provide guidance on making web content more accessible to people with a wide range of
        disabilities. These guidelines are recognized internationally and help support compliance
        with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA).
      </p>

      <h2>Ongoing Accessibility Efforts</h2>
      <p>
        Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We regularly review and update our website as part of
        our continued commitment to accessibility and ADA compliance. Our process includes a
        combination of automated reviews and manual checks to identify and address potential
        accessibility barriers. While we strive to make all content accessible, some issues may
        occasionally arise, and we are committed to resolving them in a timely manner.
      </p>

      <h2>Assistive Technology Compatibility</h2>
      <p>
        We work to ensure our website is compatible with commonly used assistive technologies,
        including screen readers, keyboard navigation, and other accessibility tools, to provide
        an inclusive experience for all users.
      </p>

      <h2>PDFs and Alternative Formats</h2>
      <p>
        Some content on this website may be provided in PDF or other document formats. We make
        reasonable efforts to ensure these materials are accessible. If you experience difficulty
        accessing any content or need information in an alternative format, please contact us and
        we will be happy to assist.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Content</h2>
      <p>
        This website may contain links to third-party websites or platforms such as Facebook,
        Instagram, YouTube, or other external services. We do not control the accessibility of
        third-party content and cannot guarantee its compliance; however, we encourage third-party
        providers to offer accessible content.
      </p>

      <h2>Feedback and Assistance</h2>
      <p>
        If you experience difficulty accessing any part of this website or have questions or
        suggestions regarding accessibility, please <a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a> or call us
        at <a href="tel:5179143555">517-914-3555</a>. We welcome feedback and are committed to
        working with users to address accessibility concerns.
      </p>

      <p><em>Last updated: June 2026</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 80ch; }
  .prose h1 { color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: var(--space-m); }
  .prose h2 { color: var(--navy); margin-top: var(--space-l); margin-bottom: var(--space-s); font-size: var(--text-l); }
  .prose a { color: var(--orange); }
</style>
